      "text": "Analysis uses frozen analysis stores, not live job/resume/grade stores or extraction services.\nShared AI Search / Foundry IQ: a nonsensitive app guide, never private source/result indexing.\nThis is repository-defined architecture; deployed services and feature flags control availability.",
